# Implementation Plan: BPS Fresh Mills E-Commerce Platform

A complete, production-grade, responsive e-commerce web application for **BPS Fresh Mills** ("Freshly Milled. Naturally Good.") — a local chakki flour business selling freshly milled chakki atta, multigrain atta, millets, and specialty flours directly to customers within a configurable 15 KM delivery radius.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Theme & Palette**: Built around warm cream/off-white background (`#FAF6F0`), dark roasted brown (`#3E2723`), natural fresh green (`#2E6F40`), and wheat/golden accents (`#D4A347`). Blue themes are strictly prohibited.
> - **Brand Story**: BPS Fresh Mills is positioned as a modern, trustworthy, quality-focused local chakki. No grandfather or family references are included anywhere.
> - **Zero Mock / Fake Buttons**: Every single button, search bar, filter, status stepper, wishlist toggle, stock decrement, delivery calculation, coupon applier, and admin action is fully functional.
> - **Dual-Mode Database Architecture**: To guarantee 100% out-of-the-box operation on any local machine (even if MongoDB is not pre-installed locally), the Node.js backend features a unified storage engine: standard MongoDB/Mongoose connection when `MONGO_URI` is provided, with an automatic persistent JSON file-backed document store fallback.
> - **Payment Mode**: Cash on Delivery (COD) only right now, built with a clean modular payment handler to seamlessly plug in Razorpay/Stripe in the future without modifying core order models.

